/T (On top of simple record keeping, you can set a monthly budget for any category. The program warns you when you are close to the limit and tells you clearly when you go over it. At the end of the month you can print a summary that shows the total, the average, and how the spending splits across categories.)
/E (On top of simple record keeping, you can set a monthly budget for any category. The program warns you when you are close to the limit and tells you clearly when you go over it. At the end of the month you can print a summary that shows the total, the average, and how the spending splits across categories.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
