<<
/Title (Expense Tracker is a small program that runs in the terminal and helps you keep a record of what you spend. You type in each expense with an amount, a category, a short description and a date. The program saves everything to a file on your computer, so your data is still there the next time you open it.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 230 0 R
/Next 387 0 R
>>
